# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Alliance, part 2 of 2 (2026-11-11). Hand-written from
# players' recordings (4-14 people per quest), with Forever's quest data for titles, levels and objectives.
# Order: Sunnyglade (the Twilight cult's farm town, levels 40-41) first, then east to Sleebo's workshop with the
# tallstriders and the marsh and a stop at Terral's Watch, Powderfuse Port (the neutral goblin port) and one loop
# round its coasts (the murlocs south-west, the crawlers, Trapclaw and the Eastsea pirates north-east, levels
# 40-43), the port again, the meadows west of it, then the hearth to Farholde Keep. Players leave the zone at about
# 40-41: our Stranglethorn Vale, Dustwallow Marsh & Swamp of Sorrows guide (40-43) carries on from Theramore.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings, 3-14 people each): Smuggler's Special after
# Smuggler's Paradise; Goes Down Smooth after Stepped Out; Drink Up! after Goes Down Smooth; Her World after Drink
# Up!; Rock 'em and Sock 'em after Gaseous Gold; All That's Left after What We Lost; An Unsettling Discovery after
# Cut Off the Heads (the elite).
# Left out on purpose:
# - WANTED: Old Rot-Chum (95120): Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42): behind a group choice only.
# - Cut Off the Heads (95562) and An Unsettling Discovery (94884) after it: Chogg'Zac is an elite (level 41):
#   behind a group choice only.
# - Smuggler's Special (95293) and Smuggler's Bargain (95294): Friz offers the first only once Smuggler's Paradise
#   is handed in, and it sends you back out to the pirates' far camp, then back to Friz again.
# - The Eastsea pirates' second wave (Unchecked Expansion 95122, A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs! 95123, See Ya,
#   Scallywags! 95165, Admiral Lamora 95124): levels 44-45, above this leg.
# - Terrors From the Deep (95260): it starts at an object no source names yet.
# - Not My Circus (95982), From Port to Port (95219): almost nobody recorded handing them in.
# - Field Marshal's Log (94885): it starts from a log only some Twilight cultists drop (three recorded players found it).
# - The Tanaris errands (I Know a Guy 95295, Shipping and Handling 95296): they end across the sea.
# - Out in the Field (95329): Demar Brant offers it only once Saving Sunnyglade is handed in, as you leave.

step Sunnyglade
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip North-west from Farholde Keep, past Terral's Watch and across the river, to Sunnyglade, the farm town the Twilight cult holds; keep clear of Rog'mar, the Horde's fort east of the town. Farmer Elbrim waits at his farm on Sunnyglade's north-eastern edge, Apprentice Claire hides at the town's eastern edge, and Fuzzle the kobold in the middle.
  accept 94829                          -- Farmer Elbrim: What We Lost
  accept 95642                          -- Apprentice Claire: Abominable Magics
  accept 95643                          -- Indiscriminate Purge
  accept 94961                          -- Fuzzle: Biting the Hand

step The Twilight cult
  tip The cultists fill the streets and fields of Sunnyglade. Start at the ritual circles in the middle (fill Claire's catalyst there), work west through the burnt houses to the edge of town, then back north-east past the loose soil, where Elbrim's mementos go. The charms, pages and finger bones drop from the cultists.
  kill 261711 x5 quest 95643.1 @47.5,50.1  -- Empowered Brute
  kill 262169 x5 quest 95643.2 @47.7,49.7  -- Twilight Ritualist
  complete 95642 @47.7,50.0             -- fill the Crystal Catalyst at the ritual circles
  collect 266424 x5 quest 94879.1 @45.9,49.6  -- Twilight Page
  kill 256952 x8 quest 94877.1 @42.4,45.4  -- Twilight Raider
  collect 267073 x20 quest 94961.1      -- Twilight Finger Bone
  kill 256798 x8 quest 94877.3          -- Twilight Neophyte
  collect 266425 x25 quest 94881.1      -- Twilight Charm
  complete 94829 @48.1,44.7             -- bury the mementos in the loose soil
  kill 254560 x8 quest 94877.2          -- Twilight Shadowmancer

step Apprentice Claire
  turnin 95642
  turnin 95643

step Cut Off the Heads
  when group 95562
  tip Chogg'Zac, the two-headed ogre, is an elite (level 41) at the western edge of Sunnyglade: grouping up is advised. Claire then has the filled catalyst for Ashe Amberhall in Farholde Keep.
  accept 95562                          -- Apprentice Claire
  collect 265750 quest 95562.1 @44.8,51.2  -- Chogg's Head
  collect 265751 quest 95562.2 @44.8,51.2  -- Zac's Head
  turnin 95562
  accept 94884                          -- An Unsettling Discovery: for Ashe Amberhall in Farholde Keep

step Fuzzle
  turnin 94961
  accept 94963                          -- Biting the Hand
  complete 94963 @41.6,47.7             -- lead Fuzzle out of Sunnyglade to his treasure, west of the town
  turnin 94963 @41.6,47.7               -- Fuzzle's Treasure

step Farmer Elbrim
  tip Back east through the town to Elbrim's farm; the doll and the locket are in the burnt farmhouse beside it.
  turnin 94829
  accept 94858                          -- All That's Left
  complete 94858 @53.6,44.9             -- the doll and the locket
  turnin 94858

step Sleebo's workshop
  tip East to Sleebo Fizzlespout's workshop on the hill beyond Rog'mar. Rog'mar is the Horde's fort, its grunts far above your level: go round its south side, across the plains.
  goto 60.0,53.0 "The plains south of Rog'mar"
  accept 96063 @68.2,48.6               -- Gaseous Gold

step The tallstriders and the marsh
  tip The Roving Tallstriders graze the meadows south-west of the workshop; further south-west the marsh bubbles with gas: fill the vials at the vents.
  collect 271778 quest 95984.1 @67.3,53.9  -- Intact Tallstrider Beak
  collect 272004 x8 quest 96063.1 @62.2,58.7  -- Marsh Gas Vial

step Terral's Watch
  tip Watcher Cornelius's tower stands just south-west of the marsh.
  turnin 95984                          -- Watcher Cornelius

step Sleebo Fizzlespout
  tip Back north-east to the workshop.
  turnin 96063 @68.2,48.6
  accept 96067 @68.2,48.6               -- Rock 'em and Sock 'em
  complete 96067 @68.2,48.6             -- the stress test: fight G45-B4G beside the workshop
  turnin 96067 @68.2,48.6

step Powderfuse Port
  tip East down the road to Powderfuse Port, the goblins' harbour. Friz Frazzlespark keeps a stall at the west end of the docks; Gray Dawnbright, Innkeeper Zizplink and Gritta Chumwater are at the inn, Fimbo Greasemitz cooks beside it, and Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz works the north pier. Zizplink's drink needs three things the port's traders sell: the chum from Gritta, the degreaser and the old poison from Kor'gar and Krikshank, just north of Friz's stall.
  turnin 94928                          -- Friz Frazzlespark
  accept 95288                          -- Smuggler's Paradise
  accept 95059                          -- Frazzlespark's Crate: for Demar Brant in Farholde Keep, keep it
  turnin 95961                          -- Gray Dawnbright
  accept 95988                          -- Innkeeper Zizplink: Goes Down Smooth
  buy 271657 npc 260487                 -- Fresh Chum, from Gritta Chumwater by the inn
  accept 95121                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz: A Taste of the Sea
  accept 95254 @78.5,53.9               -- The WANTED! poster by the inn: Trapclaw
  accept 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz: Saltwater Savages
  accept 95119                          -- Unfriendly Competition
  buy 271653 npc 260565                 -- Goblin Degreaser, from Kor'gar
  buy 271654 npc 260560                 -- Expired Poison, from Krikshank

step WANTED: Old Rot-Chum
  when group 95120
  tip Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42) on the south shore: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95120 @78.5,53.9               -- The WANTED! poster by the inn

step The murlocs, south-west
  tip South-west along the shore from the port: the saltwater murlocs camp on the beaches. The Saltwater Murloc Eyes drop from all of them.
  collect 268344 x12 quest 95121.1 @72.5,67.7  -- Saltwater Murloc Eye
  kill 256801 x8 quest 95118.1          -- Murloc Warrior
  kill 255898 x8 quest 95118.2          -- Murloc Oracle

step Old Rot-Chum
  when onquest 95120
  collect 268341 quest 95120.1 @77.6,72.0  -- Rot-Covered Harpoon

step The crawlers and Trapclaw
  tip Back past the port and north along the beach: the Shore Crawlers drop the meat for Fimbo and the spittle for Zizplink. Trapclaw, a big crab, scuttles along the rocks east of the docks.
  collect 268345 x6 quest 95121.2 @78.7,49.0  -- Sand Crawler Meat
  collect 271650 x3 quest 95988.1 @80.2,49.6  -- Crawler Spittle
  collect 268586 quest 95254.1 @83.0,50.5  -- Trapclaw's Pincer

step The Eastsea pirates
  tip North-east along the coast to the pirates' camp on the cliffs. The buccaneers and musketeers carry the smuggled goods.
  kill 257901 x10 quest 95119.1         -- Eastsea Buccaneer
  kill 257910 x10 quest 95119.2         -- Eastsea Musketeer
  collect 268796 x8 quest 95288.1 @86.4,38.1  -- Smuggled Goods

step Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  when onquest 95120
  turnin 95120

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Back to the port, from the north pier west through the docks.
  turnin 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95119
  turnin 95254                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz
  turnin 95121
  turnin 95988                          -- Innkeeper Zizplink
  accept 95957                          -- Drink Up!
  turnin 95957                          -- Gray Dawnbright
  accept 95975                          -- Her World
  turnin 95288                          -- Friz Frazzlespark

step The meadows
  tip West of the port, the wildflowers grow in the meadows below Sleebo's workshop.
  collect 271823 x20 quest 95975.1 @68.5,54.2  -- Wildflower

step Hearth to Farholde Keep
  hearth "Farholde Keep"

step Farholde Keep
  tip From the inn, east into the keep for Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall.
  turnin 95059                          -- Demar Brant
  turnin 94877
  turnin 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall
  turnin 94879

step Ashe Amberhall
  when onquest 94884
  turnin 94884

step Tessa Dawnbright
  tip Back west to Tessa Dawnbright by the orchard.
  turnin 95975

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  tip The next guide starts in Theramore: Gretchen Mayberry flies to Menethil Harbor by way of Thelsamar, and the boat crosses to Theramore from there.
  goto 60.6,81.6 "Gretchen Mayberry, gryphon master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"
